\chapter{Chapter 1: Getting Started};

\section{Section 1: Adding a new section};

A chapter is started by using the `\\chapter` command following by the title of the chapter. To add a new section, use the `\\section` command following by the title of the section.

You can use the \bold{bold};, \italic{italic}; and the \underline{underline}; commands to format the document.
